Apache Atlas Semantic Repair
============================

Backfills semantic embeddings for existing graph vertices into the JanusGraph
OpenSearch vertex index. Shipped in the semantic-indexer tarball
(apache-atlas-<version>-semantic-indexer.tar.gz).

  ATLAS_CONF=/path/to/atlas/conf bin/atlas_semantic_repair.sh [--all] [--batch-size N] [--dry-run] [--guid <guid>]

Run after enabling semantic search or changing the embedding model/dimension.
